  "$comment": "The framework's own exemplar, as data. Its two deployments hold identical declarations and differ only in the plugin id every Tool name sits under, which is what makes their registrations two rather than one. The whole declaration is this one document: there is no Tool Catalog file, no state schema and no argument schema beside it, so the only other files this project ships are its two Luau closures and its RuntimeArtifact.",
