      "plugin_authoring": "hand-written",
      "plugin_justification": "umbraflow-declarative-workflow-tool/v1 declares one tool over a fixed schedule of wait and ui_action states and renders a tool closure that exports no entry at all. This deployment binds ten Tools whose handlers answer different outcomes, so its closure has no declarative spelling.",
      "$comment": "This deployment registers no resource, and the member is written empty rather than left out because an absent member would be read as a declaration gone missing. It binds every Tool it declares to an entry of its tool closure, which is what makes those Tools reachable: a declared Tool with no binding has no code to run and the loader refuses the generation. Each Tool's effect_bounds pins a payload digest the framework compares against what a proposal carries and never resolves to bytes: with no fold, parsing an effect's meaning buys the framework no guarantee of its own.",
